wing><wp:inline distT="0" distB="0" distL="0" distR="0" wp14:anchorId="5457C43B" wp14:editId="14F5998D"><wp:extent cx="2162810" cy="1195705"/><wp:effectExtent l="0" t="0" r="8890" b="4445"/><wp:docPr id="1946148042" name="Picture 1"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="1946148042" name=""/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId11"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="2162810" cy="1195705"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p></w:txbxContent></v:textbox><w10:wrap type="square"/></v:shape></w:pict></mc:Fallback></mc:AlternateContent></w:r><w:r><w:t>Purchase receipt</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="64E8875A" w14:textId="528FE082" w:rsidR="006F1944" w:rsidRPr="00ED6298" w:rsidRDefault="006F1944" w:rsidP="006F1944"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListParagraph"/><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="6"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="006F1944"><w:t>When attempting to receive a shipment linked to an invoice, the system throws a quantity validation error during submission, even though the quantity is identical to the quantity on the invoice. As a result, the shipment cannot be submitted.</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="006F1944"><w:rPr><w:sz w:val="16"/><w:szCs w:val="16"/></w:rPr><w:t>As shown</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:sz w:val="16"/><w:szCs w:val="16"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> in the following img</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="00ED6298"><w:rPr><w:sz w:val="16"/><w:szCs w:val="16"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="67279FC9" w14:textId="56BE7DAF" w:rsidR="00461F17" w:rsidRDefault="006F1944" w:rsidP="006F1944"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListParagraph"/><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="6"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="006F1944"><w:t>When the invoice has only one entry, the system raises an error in the "Serial/Batch Bundle" field, stating that the bundle is linked to the purchase invoice. The invoice can only be submitted after the user manually clears the "Serial/Batch Bundle" field.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="181DF203" w14:textId="1A776E7C" w:rsidR="006F1944" w:rsidRDefault="006F1944" w:rsidP="006F1944"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListParagraph"/><w:numPr><w:ilvl w:val="0"/><w:numId w:val="6"/></w:numPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="006F1944"><w:t>Finally, the system no longer supports creating a Purchase Receipt from a Purchase Invoice. It only allows creating a Purchase Receipt from a Shipment. If that's the case, how are we supposed to receive locally purchased goods</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">? </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="006F1944"><w:t>When trying to create a Purchase Receipt from a Purchase Invoice, the system creates a Purchase Receipt with an empty Items table.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="66D5D214" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="007F25F5" w:rsidRDefault="007F25F5" w:rsidP="007F25F5"/><w:p w14:paraId="71B0DBDA" w14:textId="4A713CA7" w:rsidR="007F25F5" w:rsidRDefault="007F25F5" w:rsidP="007F25F5"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">Purchase invoice </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5B521918" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="007F25F5" w:rsidRDefault="007F25F5" w:rsidP="007F25F5"/><w:p w14:paraId="57CCEC4D" w14:textId="57D30EC5" w:rsidR="007F25F5" w:rsidRDefault="007F25F5" w:rsidP="007F25F5"><w:r><w:t>Update stock button makes a serious mistakes in data entry, for that doctype</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="5ED4973B" w14:textId="6CB40E27" w:rsidR="00ED6298" w:rsidRPr="007F25F5" w:rsidRDefault="00ED6298" w:rsidP="007F25F5"><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">So we need to changed to be unchecked by default . </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:sectPr w:rsidR="00ED6298" w:rsidRPr="007F25F5"><w:pgSz w:w="12240" w:h="15840"/><w:pgMar w:top="1440" w:right="1440" w:bottom="1440" w:left="1440" w:header="720" w:footer="720" w:gutter="0"/><w:cols w:space="720"/><w:docGrid w:linePitch="360"/></w:sectPr></w:body></w:document>